                                                "sense_id": "9dba8f92-ddba-3a75-9c48-01af38c4304b",
                                                "text": "But so far the unbounded effrontery of Joseph has pulled him through. However, he has now struck stormy weather, and is likely to have a short and tempestuous passage as Prime Minister."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "606ec5f8-9fda-4c5b-aa85-99ddf9a5fe3f",
                                                "sense_id": "9dba8f92-ddba-3a75-9c48-01af38c4304b",
                                                "text": "\"Never dreamed you two had struck stormy weather, though - what's the trouble?\""
                                            },
                                            {
